{"content_hash": "31ae502c341fe38f", "version_id": 874, "article_id": 88, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Storage Hunter Simulator hits PS5 and Xbox on November 24", "title_zh": "《仓库猎人模拟器》11月24日登陆PS5和Xbox", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221947", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606813907291-d86efa9b94db?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8cGxheXN0YXRpb24lMjB4Ym94JTIwc2VyaWVzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM4NDI2NTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Charles Sims on Unsplash", "author": "Charles Sims", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@1charlessims?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/white-and-black-box-on-white-table-QHha7JOJYnw?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(255, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(293, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fcb7069c8333"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-05", "word_count": 234, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Bidding fans will soon get a new way to hunt for treasure. Storage Hunter Simulator is coming to PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S on November 24, 2026, priced at $24.99.", "lead_zh": "喜欢竞拍的玩家很快就有新的寻宝方式了。《仓库猎人模拟器》将于2026年11月24日登陆PlayStation 5和Xbox Series X|S，售价24.99美元。", "preview": "Players who want the full auction experience can look at Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition. Besides the base game, this version i", "preview_zh": "想要完整体验拍卖的玩家，可以关注《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》。除了游戏本体，这个版本还包含扩展通行证，内有《后院入门包》《灯光、摄影机、开拍！包》等多个主题DLC。《概不退款版》将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元，扩展通行证也可单独购买，售价16.99美元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 857, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 92.025, "size_bytes": 553104, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 268, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 94.125, "size_bytes": 565776, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 268, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 100.15, "size_bytes": 601920, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 268, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 86.7, "size_bytes": 521136, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 268, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/88/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 94.575, "size_bytes": 568368, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 268, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/88/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@07e7785/content/data/versions/874.json", "paragraphs": ["Players who want the full auction experience can look at Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition. Besides the base game, this version includes an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack. The No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99, while the expansion pass can be bought separately for $16.99.", "In the game, players travel between auctions around town and compete with other bidders for garages, storage units and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, and players must spot valuable items and turn them into profit so their business can grow. Thousands of unique objects are waiting to be discovered, and experts can be hired to judge what they are worth.", "As the business expands, players unlock tools to value items themselves, buy a pawn shop and manage resources by investing in equipment, upgrading facilities and hiring staff. Those who prefer company can invite up to three friends into a drop-in, drop-out co-op adventure, where the team shares one bank account and must plan carefully before bidding begins.", "The game also offers a relaxed mode, a harder difficulty, achievements, seven vehicles to drive and an open world with five regions and many secrets. It supports single play and co-op for up to four people, letting players split up to attend different auctions and maximise their profits."], "paragraphs_zh": ["想要完整体验拍卖的玩家，可以关注《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》。除了游戏本体，这个版本还包含扩展通行证，内有《后院入门包》《灯光、摄影机、开拍！包》等多个主题DLC。《概不退款版》将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元，扩展通行证也可单独购买，售价16.99美元。", "在游戏中，玩家穿梭于城镇各处的拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱里的物品。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜，玩家要从中发现值钱的东西并赚取利润，让生意逐步壮大。游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，玩家还可以请专家鉴定物品价值。", "随着生意扩大，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具，买下典当行，并通过投资设备、升级设施和雇用员工来管理资源。不想独自冒险的玩家可以邀请最多三位好友，加入随时进出合作模式；团队共用一个银行账户，必须在拍卖开始前好好商量。", "游戏还提供轻松模式和更高难度、成就系统、七种可驾驶载具，以及拥有五个区域和众多秘密的开放世界。它支持单人游玩和最多四人合作，玩家可以分头前往不同的拍卖现场，把收益做到最大。"], "body": "Players who want the full auction experience can look at Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition. Besides the base game, this version includes an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack. The No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99, while the expansion pass can be bought separately for $16.99.\n\nIn the game, players travel between auctions around town and compete with other bidders for garages, storage units and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, and players must spot valuable items and turn them into profit so their business can grow. Thousands of unique objects are waiting to be discovered, and experts can be hired to judge what they are worth.\n\nAs the business expands, players unlock tools to value items themselves, buy a pawn shop and manage resources by investing in equipment, upgrading facilities and hiring staff. Those who prefer company can invite up to three friends into a drop-in, drop-out co-op adventure, where the team shares one bank account and must plan carefully before bidding begins.\n\nThe game also offers a relaxed mode, a harder difficulty, achievements, seven vehicles to drive and an open world with five regions and many secrets. It supports single play and co-op for up to four people, letting players split up to attend different auctions and maximise their profits.", "body_zh": "想要完整体验拍卖的玩家，可以关注《仓库猎人模拟器：概不退款版》。除了游戏本体，这个版本还包含扩展通行证，内有《后院入门包》《灯光、摄影机、开拍！包》等多个主题DLC。《概不退款版》将在包括PC在内的所有平台推出，售价34.99美元，扩展通行证也可单独购买，售价16.99美元。\n\n在游戏中，玩家穿梭于城镇各处的拍卖会，与其他竞拍者争夺车库、储物间和集装箱里的物品。每场拍卖都可能藏着惊喜，玩家要从中发现值钱的东西并赚取利润，让生意逐步壮大。游戏中有数千种独特物品等待发现，玩家还可以请专家鉴定物品价值。\n\n随着生意扩大，玩家会解锁自行估价的工具，买下典当行，并通过投资设备、升级设施和雇用员工来管理资源。不想独自冒险的玩家可以邀请最多三位好友，加入随时进出合作模式；团队共用一个银行账户，必须在拍卖开始前好好商量。\n\n游戏还提供轻松模式和更高难度、成就系统、七种可驾驶载具，以及拥有五个区域和众多秘密的开放世界。它支持单人游玩和最多四人合作，玩家可以分头前往不同的拍卖现场，把收益做到最大。", "text": "Players who want the full auction experience can look at Storage Hunter Simulator: No Refunds Edition. Besides the base game, this version includes an expansion pass with several themed DLC packs, such as the Backyard Starter Pack and the Lights, Camera, Action! Pack. The No Refunds Edition will launch on all platforms, including PC, for $34.99, while the expansion pass can be bought separately for $16.99. In the game, players travel between auctions around town and compete with other bidders for garages, storage units and shipping containers. Each auction may hide a surprise, and players must spot valuable items and turn them into profit so their business can grow. Thousands of unique objects are waiting to be discovered, and experts can be hired to judge what they are worth. As the business expands, players unlock tools to value items themselves, buy a pawn shop and manage resources by investing in equipment, upgrading facilities and hiring staff. Those who prefer company can invite up to three friends into a drop-in, drop-out co-op adventure, where the team shares one bank account and must plan carefully before bidding begins. The game also offers a relaxed mode, a harder difficulty, achievements, seven vehicles to drive and an open world with five regions and many secrets. It supports single play and co-op for up to four people, letting players split up to attend different auctions and maximise their profits.", "vocab": [{"word": "auction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拍卖", "note": "常见搭配：attend an auction 参加拍卖", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bidder", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞拍者", "note": "动词 bid 出价", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion pass", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "扩展通行证", "note": "游戏术语，含多个后续DLC", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "DLC", "pos": "noun", "zh": "追加下载内容", "note": "downloadable content 的缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "storage unit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "储物间", "note": "自助仓储出租的小隔间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "container", "pos": "noun", "zh": "集装箱", "note": "shipping container 货运集装箱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spot", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发现，认出", "note": "口语常用，指一眼看到", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "appraise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "鉴定估价", "note": "名词 appraisal 估价", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pawn shop", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "典当行", "note": "典当物品换钱的店铺", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drop-in, drop-out", "pos": "adj", "zh": "随时加入退出的", "note": "多用于合作游戏模式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "co-op", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合作模式", "note": "cooperative 的缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "maximise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使最大化", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 maximize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-05T01:37:37.647708", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Players", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.637, "sm": 275, "em": 637, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "who", "s": 0.637, "e": 0.775, "sm": 637, "em": 774, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "want", "s": 0.775, "e": 0.963, "sm": 775, "em": 962, "cs": 12, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "the", "s": 0.963, "e": 1.062, "sm": 962, "em": 1062, "cs": 17, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "full", "s": 1.062, "e": 1.3, "sm": 1062, "em": 1300, "cs": 21, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "auction", "s": 1.3, "e": 1.65, "sm": 1300, "em": 1649, "cs": 26, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "experience", "s": 1.65, "e": 2.275, "sm": 1650, "em": 2275, "cs": 34, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "can", "s": 2.275, "e": 2.425, "sm": 2275, "em": 2424, "cs": 45, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "look", "s": 2.425, "e": 2.587, "sm": 2425, "em": 2587, "cs": 49, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "at", "s": 2.587, "e": 2.675, "sm": 2587, "em": 2674, "cs": 54, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "Storage", "s": 2.675, "e": 3.075, "sm": 2675, "em": 3074, "cs": 57, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "Hunter", "s": 3.075, "e": 3.4, "sm": 3075, "em": 3399, "cs": 65, "ce": 71, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "Simulator", "s": 3.4, "e": 4.3, "sm": 3400, "em": 4300, "cs": 72, "ce": 81, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": ":", "s": 4.3, "e": 4.475, "sm": 4300, "em": 4474, "cs": 81, "ce": 82, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "No", "s": 4.475, "e": 4.7, "sm": 4475, "em": 4699, "cs": 83, "ce": 85, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "Refunds", "s": 4.7, "e": 5.088, "sm": 4700, "em": 5087, "cs": 86, "ce": 93, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "Edition", "s": 5.088, "e": 5.95, "sm": 5087, "em": 5949, "cs": 94, "ce": 101, "si": 0}, {"i": 17, "w": ".", "s": 5.95, "e": 6.088, "sm": 5950, "em": 6087, "cs": 101, "ce": 102, "si": 0}, {"i": 18, "w": "Besides", "s": 6.088, "e": 6.512, "sm": 6087, "em": 6512, "cs": 103, "ce": 110, "si": 1}, {"i": 19, "w": "th